When the user asks for a combined weekly squad digest reading both migration-program-manager's and
cost-optimization-sprint-planner's own rollup outputs, read `weekly-squad-digest/SKILL.md` and follow it.
A single-source migration status or cost/waste question routes to `migration-program-manager/SKILL.md` or
`cost-optimization-sprint-planner/SKILL.md` directly instead — this skill sets
`disable-model-invocation: true`, so it is not the ambient-chat default for either single-source
question; invoke it explicitly by name for the combined digest.

Phase index: `weekly-squad-digest/reference/phase-index.md`. Reference loads:
`weekly-squad-digest/reference/lazy-load-index.md`.
Read-only — never invokes migration-program-manager, cost-optimization-sprint-planner, or squad-map live,
only reads the first two skills' already-produced rollup JSON files. Only writes its own
`WEEKLY_SQUAD_DIGEST.md`.
